      <description>&lt;p&gt;I took my master thesis as a poster to &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.sibe-iseb.it/en/firenze2026&#34;&gt;Firenze 2026&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The topic was &amp;ldquo;Multi-Marker Analysis of the Bark Beetle Mycobiome Detects Significant Region-specific Biases&amp;rdquo;, under the supervision of Dr. Vienna Kowallik.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The trip was sponsored by &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.europaeische-stiftungsweingueter.eu/unsere-weingueter/mueller-fahnenberg-stiftung-freiburg/index.html&#34;&gt;Müller-Fahnenberg Stiftung&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href=&#34;https://uni-freiburg.de/universitaet/foerdern-und-stiften/stifter-und-stiftungen-der-albert-ludwigs-universitaet/#M%C3%BCller-Fahnenberg-Stiftung&#34;&gt;Uni Freiburg partner&lt;/a&gt;) and SIBE&amp;rsquo;s travel grant for students.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The poster will be posted here after thesis submission (Sep 23, 2026).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
